NAME
    gcloud alpha apihub - manage Apihub resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha apihub GROUP [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage Apihub resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     addons
        (ALPHA) Manage Addon resources.

     api-hub-instances
        (ALPHA) Manage Api Hub Instance resources.

     apis
        (ALPHA) Manage Api resources.

     attributes
        (ALPHA) Manage Attribute resources.

     curations
        (ALPHA) Manage Curation resources.

     dependencies
        (ALPHA) Manage Dependency resources.

     deployments
        (ALPHA) Manage Deployment resources.

     discovered-api-observations
        (ALPHA) Manage Discovered Api Observation resources.

     external-apis
        (ALPHA) Manage External Api resources.

     host-project-registrations
        (ALPHA) Manage Host Project Registration resources.

     operations
        (ALPHA) Manage Operation resources.

     plugins
        (ALPHA) Manage Plugin resources.

     runtime-project-attachments
        (ALPHA) Manage Runtime Project Attachment resources.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist. This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud apihub

